+# Storefront exit-lifecycle patch
+
+Built on 2026-10-13 from the upstream BlazorBlueprint `primitives/v4.1.0` source at commit `9534520512db530e640b7bca878d73f7c444874e`.
+
+The upstream package is licensed under Apache-2.0. This candidate retains its exact `LICENSE`, `NOTICE`, copyright metadata, and repository metadata. The package contains this provenance note at `docs/STOREFRONT_EXIT_PATCH.md`.
+
+## Scope
+
+The patch retains Sheet and JavaScript-strategy Dialog portal content after close while finite animations attached to the modal content and overlay finish. The retained nodes become inert and hidden from assistive technology. A generation token prevents an old exit callback from removing a reopened modal. Reduced-motion and absent-portal paths complete immediately. The coordinator cancels work during reopen or disposal.
+
+Native HTML dialog behavior is deliberately unchanged. The two storefronts use the JavaScript dialog strategy.
+
+## Modified upstream files
+
+- `src/BlazorBlueprint.Primitives/Primitives/Sheet/SheetContext.cs` and `BbSheet*.razor`
+- `src/BlazorBlueprint.Primitives/Primitives/Dialog/DialogContext.cs` and `BbDialog*.razor`
+- `src/BlazorBlueprint.Primitives/wwwroot/js/primitives/modal-exit.js`
+- `src/BlazorBlueprint.Primitives/BlazorBlueprint.Primitives.csproj`
+
+## Rebuild
+
+From this checkout, run:
+
+```powershell
+dotnet build src/BlazorBlueprint.Primitives/BlazorBlueprint.Primitives.csproj
+dotnet pack src/BlazorBlueprint.Primitives/BlazorBlueprint.Primitives.csproj -p:MinVerVersionOverride=4.1.1-storefront.1 -p:StorefrontExitPatch=true -o candidate-artifacts
+```
+
+The output is `candidate-artifacts/BlazorBlueprint.Primitives.4.1.1-storefront.1.nupkg`. Its assembly version remains the upstream-compatible `4.0.0.0`.
